@baseUrl = http://localhost:51820

### Source-aware capability (legacy /health and /api/v2/health remain unchanged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v3/health

### Start one reporting generation shared by all local integrations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v3/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocolVersion": 3,
  "kind": "started",
  "eventId": "cb889ff6-2b6f-4a52-8ed2-07b3e814601a",
  "machineId": "5b8185c1-8860-4780-b24e-197d746adfb9",
  "machineName": "example-devbox",
  "client": "agent-signaler",
  "clientVersion": "1.0",
  "generation": 1,
  "sequence": 1,
  "reportedAtUtc": "2026-09-15T18:00:00Z",
  "heartbeatIntervalSeconds": 300,
  "sessions": []
}

### Stop execution, not the session; no success overlay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v3/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocolVersion": 3,
  "kind": "hook",
  "eventId": "fc1b7448-4b3c-4ac5-b254-b854006177df",
  "machineId": "5b8185c1-8860-4780-b24e-197d746adfb9",
  "machineName": "example-devbox",
  "client": "agent-signaler",
  "clientVersion": "1.0",
  "generation": 1,
  "sequence": 2,
  "reportedAtUtc": "2026-09-15T18:00:01Z",
  "hook": {
    "protocolVersion": 3,
    "eventId": "fc1b7448-4b3c-4ac5-b254-b854006177df",
    "machineId": "5b8185c1-8860-4780-b24e-197d746adfb9",
    "machineName": "example-devbox",
    "client": "vscode",
    "clientVersion": "1.137.0",
    "source": { "kind": "vscode", "scopeId": "local-profile", "version": "1.137.0" },
    "sessionId": "host-session",
    "event": "executionStopped",
    "reportedAtUtc": "2026-09-15T18:00:01Z"
  }
}

### Error: source-aware reports cannot be downgraded to the legacy route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocolVersion": 3,
  "kind": "offline",
  "eventId": "6b6eb5ba-a449-420b-ad08-c3cbe48c9b5e",
